Cell["\<\
Jiles makes a good point about how the magnetic field may be co-axial to the \
applied stress, Eq (4):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982234660276682*^9, 
  3.9822346928298264`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4e7b23c8-37fe-4749-974d-\
